auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  End-to-end walkthrough of the logistics assistant API (UC01–UC08 and the auth stack).

  Select the **Local** environment and run the folders in order. Later requests reuse ids saved from earlier responses (`accessToken`, `refreshToken`, `vehicleId`, `jobId1`, `jobId2`, `routeId`).
}
